So relate the stories, perhaps they may reflect.

9
00:00:48,669 --> 00:00:55,862
فَٱقْصُصِ ٱلْقَصَصَ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَتَفَكَّرُونَ۞

10
00:00:55,957 --> 00:01:00,592
So relate the stories, perhaps they may reflect.

11
00:01:00,711 --> 00:01:01,409
Adam(آدَم),

12
00:01:01,449 --> 00:01:02,259
Sheeth(شيث‎),

13
00:01:02,330 --> 00:01:03,314
Idrees(إدريس),

14
00:01:03,386 --> 00:01:04,203
Noah(نوح),

15
00:01:04,298 --> 00:01:05,040
Hud(هود),

16
